    <!-- Provider: Riot -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_Help">Reading League of Legends Challenges uses Riot's official API, which needs a free API key tied to your Riot account. Riot publishes no per-player endpoint that works without one:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Riot_SetupStep2">2. Copy the development API key shown on the dashboard into the API Key box below. Use the regenerate button there if it has expired.</sys:String>
